---
title: "initializePublishSaleResults (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller not authorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_timing: caller authorized
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_timing: block.timestamp <= refundEndTime
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodNotEnded
    q_check_timing --> q_lock: refund period ended
    q_lock --> q_publish_key: lock cancellation (isCancellationLocked = true)
    q_publish_key --> [*]: publish ECIES private key, emit ResultsInitialized

    note right of q_lock
        INV-001: cancellation locked permanently after this call
        INV-002: private key enables public bid decryption
    end note

    note right of q_publish_key
        INV-003: two-step publish: initialize first, then publishSaleResults
        INV-004: gap between steps allows public bid verification
    end note
